  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In cooperation with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Latvia and its implementing agency, Ireland supports the establishment of a comprehensive societal resilience platform for war-affected women and children in Ukraine, by increasing access to psychosocial support, promoting economic empowerment, and fostering supportive communities. Implemented by the Latvian NGO Marta Centrs, the project falls within the framework of the Ukrainian Mental Health Programme, &#x201c;How are you?&#x201d;</narrative>
